{"seq":2,"slug":"species-interactions","title":"物种间相互作用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/ecology/population-ecology/species-interactions","wordCount":3047,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"物种间相互作用\">物种间相互作用</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>物种间相互作用（Species Interactions）是塑造群落结构和驱动种群动态的核心力量。在任何生态系统中，物种并非孤立存在，而是通过捕食、竞争、共生、寄生和互利等多种关系编织成复杂的交互网络。这些相互作用的性质和强度决定了哪些物种能够共存、种群如何波动以及群落如何响应环境变化。</p>\n<p>理解物种间相互作用是连接 <a href=\"population-dynamics\">种群动态</a> 与 <a href=\"../community-ecology/biodiversity-metrics\">群落生态学</a> 的关键桥梁。它解释了为什么特定物种组合能够稳定共存，以及为什么移除或引入某个物种可能引发整个群落的级联变化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>本节汇总贯穿全篇的核心术语，其作用方向与机制在后续各节展开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>相互作用分类</td>\n<td>按对双方增长率的影响方向（+/0/-）划分六类关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>捕食</td>\n<td>捕食者获益、猎物受损，用 Lotka-Volterra 方程描述</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>功能反应</td>\n<td>单个捕食者捕食率随猎物密度的变化（I/II/III 型）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>竞争</td>\n<td>双方受损；竞争排斥原理与生态位分化解释共存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>互利共生</td>\n<td>双方获益，如传粉、菌根、固氮共生，常被低估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>寄生</td>\n<td>寄生者获益、寄主受损但通常不立即致死</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>条件依赖性</td>\n<td>相互作用性质可随环境由互利转为寄生、由竞争转为促进</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>间接相互作用</td>\n<td>通过共享天敌或营养级联产生的非两两直接效应</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"相互作用的分类框架\">相互作用的分类框架</h2><p>物种间相互作用按照对双方种群增长率的影响方向分为：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>相互作用类型</th>\n<th>物种 A</th>\n<th>物种 B</th>\n<th>典型案例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>竞争（Competition）</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>两种雀类争夺同一食物资源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>捕食（Predation）</td>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>狼捕食驼鹿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>寄生（Parasitism）</td>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>疟原虫感染人类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>互利共生（Mutualism）</td>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>蜜蜂与花朵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>偏利共生（Commensalism）</td>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>藤壶附着鲸鱼</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>偏害（Amensalism）</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>胡桃树分泌化感物质抑制周围植物</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注：+ 表示有利，- 表示不利，0 表示无影响。</p>\n<h2 id=\"捕食\">捕食</h2><h3 id=\"捕食的类型\">捕食的类型</h3><p>广义的捕食包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>真正的捕食</strong>（True Predation）：捕食者杀死猎物个体（狼吃兔）</li>\n<li><strong>草食</strong>（Herbivory）：动物取食植物组织（通常不杀死植物个体）</li>\n<li><strong>拟寄生</strong>（Parasitoidism）：寄生蜂在寄主体内产卵，幼虫最终杀死寄主</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"lotka-volterra-捕食模型\">Lotka-Volterra 捕食模型</h3><p>经典的捕食者-猎物模型由两个耦合微分方程描述：</p>\n<p><strong>猎物种群：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{dN}{dt} = rN - aNP</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>捕食者种群：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{dP}{dt} = baNP - mP</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>N = 猎物数量，P = 捕食者数量</li>\n<li>r = 猎物内禀增长率</li>\n<li>a = 捕食系数（搜索效率）</li>\n<li>b = 转化效率（将猎物转化为捕食者后代的效率）</li>\n<li>m = 捕食者死亡率</li>\n</ul>\n<p>该模型预测捕食者和猎物种群呈中性周期振荡，猎物峰值领先于捕食者峰值约 1/4 周期。</p>\n<h3 id=\"功能反应\">功能反应</h3><p><strong>功能反应</strong>（Functional Response）描述单个捕食者的捕食率如何随猎物密度变化：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>I 型</strong>（线性）：捕食率与猎物密度成正比（如滤食动物）</li>\n<li><strong>II 型</strong>（饱和型，Holling 圆盘方程）：低密度时近似线性，高密度时趋于饱和<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(N) = \\frac{aN}{1 + ahN}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ah</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>其中 h = 处理时间（handling time）</li>\n<li><strong>III 型</strong>（S 型）：低密度时加速增加，高密度时饱和（捕食者的&quot;搜索映像&quot;形成）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>III 型功能反应对猎物种群的调节作用最强，因为它在猎物低密度时给予&quot;庇护&quot;，在中等密度时施加最大捕食压力。</p>\n<h3 id=\"数值反应\">数值反应</h3><p><strong>数值反应</strong>（Numerical Response）指捕食者种群数量对猎物密度变化的响应：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>繁殖性数值反应：更多食物 → 更多后代</li>\n<li>聚集性数值反应：捕食者向高猎物密度区集中</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"捕食者-猎物协同进化\">捕食者-猎物协同进化</h3><p>捕食压力驱动了一系列进化适应：</p>\n<p><strong>猎物的防御策略：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>形态防御：刺、壳、体型增大</li>\n<li>化学防御：毒素、次级代谢物</li>\n<li>行为防御：群居、警戒、逃避</li>\n<li>隐蔽与拟态：保护色、贝氏拟态、缪氏拟态</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>捕食者的反适应：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>感官增强：嗅觉、听觉、视觉的特化</li>\n<li>运动能力：速度、敏捷性</li>\n<li>合作狩猎：狼群、狮群的协作</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这种持续的适应-反适应过程被称为&quot;进化军备竞赛&quot;（Evolutionary Arms Race），是 <a href=\"../../../evolutionary-biology/\">进化生物学</a> 中协同进化理论的经典案例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"竞争\">竞争</h2><h3 id=\"竞争的类型\">竞争的类型</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>种间竞争</strong>（Interspecific Competition）：不同物种间的竞争</li>\n<li><strong>种内竞争</strong>（Intraspecific Competition）：同一物种个体间的竞争（已在 <a href=\"population-dynamics\">种群动态</a> 中作为密度依赖机制讨论）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>按机制分：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>利用性竞争</strong>（Exploitation Competition）：通过消耗共享资源间接抑制对方</li>\n<li><strong>干涉性竞争</strong>（Interference Competition）：直接的攻击、领域防御或化学抑制</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"竞争排斥原理\">竞争排斥原理</h3><p>Gause（1934）的竞争排斥原理（Competitive Exclusion Principle）：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>两个物种如果利用完全相同的生态位，则不能长期共存——竞争能力较弱者将被排斥。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>用数学表达（Lotka-Volterra 竞争模型）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>12</mn></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{dN_1}{dt} = r_1 N_1 \\left(\\frac{K_1 - N_1 - \\alpha_{12}N_2}{K_1}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"m